{"id": "ds:149:270:Dialogue Text", "source": "What's your sexual orientation?", "sourceSha256": "36142cdfbe76a95c66fa1dc71a86e0c1edafd7717803b6ec661b13349178d550", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b0a51ca1580d82142ee1603d8cdfc4853a4d416c5869cb5480f1d01bf051decd"}
{"id": "ds:149:271:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Oh you know me, dear. I’m not picky at all.", "sourceSha256": "c59fe69b7abaea55334413d9906e43b7d9b4dd5887bf9ee1b3af3b133c6da26b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9dca1c6071605d6a961b06702aa3e5e38e37017be10f78002acb1aae407d1d05"}
{"id": "ds:149:272:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I’ll always have a soft spot for you boys, of course!", "sourceSha256": "d5f2c9a70048b3f1f2e520a4b6966940f992bd93a9273e722cff71c6660bd0b0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7c4eb916ef89260614a28c18aae6b36277cd2de53bd2521ffafe3a8056862dfc"}
{"id": "ds:149:273:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]But I can get down with anyone!", "sourceSha256": "a78ff27a220d630f4e902ae3d681b7bb769b7a1f77e7273fb86c9af1cfaf3e1c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d8a209f409e27024912fb3f7ec992947bf510976f3ebff3661fbec3df4658747"}
{"id": "ds:149:274:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I just like makin’ critters squirm!", "sourceSha256": "10b504152af28a96d91e528ef7f98df435fdfaa509af287fc8f12f51586f083b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c7e1bfbc90179d70aff149a418b22341041ad42bad3cf58588973b022091c917"}
{"id": "ds:169:187:Dialogue Text", "source": "Bucky", "sourceSha256": "a527748bdee00615eff42f62ffa61a2e6260032a9387e9313aa8be51435c0f32", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a667f2e579f3f9f2fe910a257bdef8a62346e0a5eca83850a8f1233e1518a0d1"}
{"id": "ds:169:188:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Oh good ole Barnaby!", "sourceSha256": "590acc46a6f68dba5dccebaaee8497ec05b89104033a42137d18f703a9577abd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "3306859725fd4bb816b9e6fe3ab71b932d4b2c0f1520ee3b9aa4aaf813898a6e"}
{"id": "ds:169:189:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]He and I have been neighbors forever. He’s so helpful and handy!", "sourceSha256": "6ac38cec58fabe2062a0b69e432b06b3b62416d3681e6755b26f057f3920a8e1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2f789fefb354f8fe05f76de313e634ae482ac807ac4b03aa44d001b2183ad452"}
{"id": "ds:169:190:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I’ve had him over many times to fix up the house! He’s always happy to be of service.", "sourceSha256": "b24b528213e32d3c0d733fe7a617ce09eb448c3cd7b7a6f2770f8bab50ced7bb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "fd8fbb19b3da8d10c40d1c9775cbc7e0a26e23aeb73e3e900ae6f914b26f63bd"}
{"id": "ds:169:191:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]… Y’know…", "sourceSha256": "ea906be73ad7b1b65d4bd56a2280efe00cc8978214e00a75fe84dcb6802edf36", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "937915c33bd77d996fc3775c510eb8756d6ab4a7132275eb4844e849e1b10487"}
{"id": "ds:169:192:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Despite him favoring the male critters, he used to swing with my husband and I back in the day!", "sourceSha256": "700b911f508454ccd0f2d44939b30d9d6e4ceb849ae6e9baa0306006cbe55b8c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "bf655acef223cef192c68f8e2e742ba58f3bf40a36438d3566f669d8d2c8a90b"}
{"id": "ds:169:193:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]It’s clear he was in it more for my husband, but he was a gentleman to me all the same!", "sourceSha256": "706e709b0b9231281b920666b68891772f7e47c089db8a7e0fa774ed9c2ff186", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "398dd6ec954be965978ed79fb0bb694ad3b316317ae4c8f0571cc07010432ece"}
{"id": "ds:297:134:Dialogue Text", "source": "Do you have a partner?", "sourceSha256": "84433669bc988c8043e9f5a3333cb1373e3b45062f52551490f1356759cf36ad", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9746009d1d6b9acd165b6af57c4a2faf6a2e8bae2873837478f9a80dc1116343"}
{"id": "ds:297:136:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]A partner? Naw, this is a pretty solo venture.", "sourceSha256": "2c43d75fd8dbcd97123d6b63c8ab3b4d92f02e513546946c648b240e6da47d41", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "43cd497d7fbde3530ecee1845c490c26e982fca8a8ead1f9d06391a4c4c1d93e"}
{"id": "ds:297:137:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Why do you ask Red, you want in as a business partner?", "sourceSha256": "0e6802a09c664407d786af0385da19cd5a3db96ba0374027ee0f46a9c40510d8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "4bf7b31300754cb87e3493999ef982f93ddf79fabc9260d31132af23e41fb93f"}
{"id": "ds:297:138:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I might be able to cut you in… but we wouldn’t be look at anything more than 7 percent…", "sourceSha256": "7a6c9fb20d3a14ed9d6227bf9c459559094ff0f4d7d39e4f5e5dd5de08f4dbdd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "dba3fc93eac80f0b7c712f628204c2bec62bbeb9c2be32bcbbdb55ce44869d70"}
{"id": "ds:297:141:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Ooooooh!", "sourceSha256": "7da483fb7d505b483b4895e94ecbf7283ebb565c9585edea2b11f65019c3dd19", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d3393be847f7cd2113e722ff1bc9df2028f5da2215eef95eef1e0a0047527085"}
{"id": "ds:297:142:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]Naw, I don’t really have time for that sorta thing…", "sourceSha256": "7c083340fa51ffe6b24cb020820c8f09707bd6cdc5866cedb69c98dc1aa41b20", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "786c19f6c118ef6f2743e36ec2e933e2ba6a4416912d7c083f4a5b8f451ef485"}
{"id": "ds:297:152:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]She was absolutely inviting me to join… but uh…", "sourceSha256": "de76ea626858a735c1d3253e66af19188e737876f000c8cee9ca831f3478bfb1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "233b3dd5f1391239003dc64d59d55cf433563c3cef0f62d80cee68037783cd13"}
{"id": "ds:297:153:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]For some reason… I couldn’t accept it…", "sourceSha256": "9f606544721d62586afa033f64c067371d5cb327c14ea08349abed45525dc606", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c0a7c6b8994492257ebd4835cf5a221c58da5dc87c01b5c030b240c0a6af6c56"}
{"id": "ds:297:154:Dialogue Text", "source": "Whys that? Were you shy?", "sourceSha256": "fffca2317fa629fea1fe7e9ad6d554a1cb5989a9265669d2c2c0560838475936", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "534670e0849163475193b63ace62adb3048811ca4b6c4edc765a7bd0f39221a1"}
{"id": "ds:297:155:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Hmm… No not quite that…", "sourceSha256": "8dd1b386a2d5f6a767dade9c23d8c75071d8832540c4e4f28b4a121c314b5c86", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "80db0e5607c68fdfd6072138e39cf71811e89ac7b9d3c55dbebb19d9e2d4ff4c"}
{"id": "ds:297:156:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I dunno Red… There was something different about her…", "sourceSha256": "838464074dce793557b7dd9da5da7887d6d8257ed6a3b8840622f2b61bf14f63", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1a0c78a1fda7da8fe00594fe0a2c0957a05bf86441224dc2046042ce4bdf8c66"}
{"id": "ds:297:157:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I just got kinda scared that… maybe that was a path I wasn’t ready for…", "sourceSha256": "ae7d6fa058faeb136fa4a147b7022e9a93140b324725961286ea36f97ec4d4d8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "72ca3d0216325a13cf71a12822b3c0f2c0cf46f1d60152f25522b8655a849c02"}
{"id": "ds:297:158:Dialogue Text", "source": "What do you mean?", "sourceSha256": "c8ac7dce03b1b9b73d09f9d628650393280722336ab394f0fe830107d597c867", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "af059d5fa3ecf373acc8aab8c614866c3b8dfd685ef031e57575a703d8132dbe"}
{"id": "ds:297:159:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Well I just don’t have time for something serious, y’know?", "sourceSha256": "4d99e47eab73a4d036767fa73db04ca31eb4688c8021f769201b81cbd9894fa6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ce2dc241b6f6ac374f0dc65eb51428e7dbe8cd9d60fc778984a45f225d85fd00"}
{"id": "ds:297:160:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]It’s a lot of work running a business.", "sourceSha256": "62b8baedc64441539e4e06244f3216dbc975b7ec11f45c7f7357114ffc92dbf7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "38fbe17ea726f8de043a20686e15ba79226b358a1f5734a1a76c6f4d2084381d"}
{"id": "ds:297:161:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]So it’s hard to imagine squeezing in a relationship…", "sourceSha256": "72718533e4b3e592d633466d3b2e77003252f2ace6867b2d51a88055b3eb2276", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a4afc0342ce84b33f5ff7e5f4e23a8a8e0c9af2ca17345849dc7fc7e024c43c9"}
{"id": "ds:297:162:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]But, that’s not to say I don’t sleep around!", "sourceSha256": "c4b685cf85fa92fd11f4f592d47ff482a031df10393cb52fcd815b5beaad9a1c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a217c3342058daf41927fb5f39b35deddb1de695deff88eed1553042ea3a6cd7"}
{"id": "ds:297:163:Dialogue Text", "source": "Do tell!", "sourceSha256": "46e0e967ae26fb4ed087b6f7869ddbf9c63bef702cd06abf6e43a3752b36fffe", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5f40b60bf2a0ce18097475ca609241ce9c5e92d269b4f49a4ad153b92e49cdc0"}
{"id": "ds:297:164:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Heh, there’s a nice lil lagoon down the river.", "sourceSha256": "714881a6bcf64597502edc14cb5940bc939fbd16ba6720eb78b0e8845f67f978", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "22ffbbdda329471e4645ce7cb7a937dcb44c0b56b5d5ef79f857002fe6db0055"}
{"id": "ds:297:165:Dialogue Text", "source": "Well maybe she didn’t want\nanything serious.", "sourceSha256": "abb540f2378a48dd9815405f9b1b76207a9df73cbfd748f89f29408a88cc722c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "8879a9d6ecff9706cb575d8db2b10c34491289048ded744c3f16f26719888594"}
{"id": "ds:297:166:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Hm… That could be true…", "sourceSha256": "47a6b59bc9a1abc777da1a695753c1900b6da27736ce125ab4936d40d0d1fecf", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0941b8f4e94c330caf3b2f67a0aefb5b12d734e9dd9a8d7c028d762ae5d91dd4"}
{"id": "ds:297:167:Dialogue Text", "source": "You haven’t talked to her?", "sourceSha256": "e35d4ec8a403c58ceb0076034d24ad4a567733ecec40d3b14641081a0b79c359", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c5f4940febc6d33bf5e7898fe6d8aaa8473fe1b0e3fabe98b78fbd25eab1d0ac"}
{"id": "ds:297:168:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]… No not yet…", "sourceSha256": "9d3bfb48b76faa86573c1983428c8b3765bf9484953b71066178da8ae91bbe8c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "8f8485fb3393ebbef923338f0d1f4a2d97fab7871d6cdee9dd36c49b02ece83d"}
{"id": "ds:297:169:Dialogue Text", "source": "You should!\nShe seems interested, and\nit might be a fun opportunity.", "sourceSha256": "1e403f368906d0db1d7d79fef137d1c9e1a3a0a807c1f88325d0b771e321ca03", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f968d4155ff82e12ada36fb08172fe402eec5b012bcc77765aab054bff14fafe"}
{"id": "ds:297:170:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]It’s a common place to go for a quick hook up!", "sourceSha256": "303ea8ea5baffa00c69a329cf23deb23097f71adecddc48a1e99f1dfb031167a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "538e00ac040585914f48b21a6a7bf1bbb19b2922bfd430a8d72fb10f32a6acbd"}
{"id": "ds:297:171:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Red, I ain’t gonna sugar coat it, it’s basically a non-stop orgy.", "sourceSha256": "eb6204db7cf3e6365a0372d18fe75369fa59dfb18e50a6dfdf61cff93328a3cb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1e5e0ee5793cb4f312b048df92e43a6ac449773b99a366740d55af09bd590e02"}
{"id": "ds:297:172:Dialogue Text", "source": "Whaaaa?", "sourceSha256": "31c42e70b0b2cffb3d838233d205cfc822cbc3202a86600d42989c7da3d25166", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f714f9c1d4c3106aa266c8db6c7f0cc7f7628c7bd374f2964560f98d65d81021"}
{"id": "ds:297:173:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Yep! I used to spend a lot of time there! Buncha party animals!", "sourceSha256": "e4cc45acae978398f57e6aa6fa1e3aff9635f12cdd5df17253e9f1fde5661994", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1f0bd520a61f53491dff16f43393fd3d53e32b6ed4b0b834f305f176e808530b"}
{"id": "ds:297:174:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Not quite my speed these days… but I meet up with some old friends and fool around here ’n there.", "sourceSha256": "1c3be35a41d91cee9aa764c23f7c6c99e84858b575c2c9b088a467213a16d35c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "26763871041784d61c7a94887184ebe90b4e9f176f3ab2f16632eb31ada24bf2"}
{"id": "ds:297:175:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]I should really take ya down there sometime!", "sourceSha256": "e17f585f94e223adf0efefb9027c5f3fea365ea162cd6f4f4d48bf7443b5f202", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5b6087002f04f063ab43a3b34b314ac64232c141ead71035bda7d3c11040a3d1"}
{"id": "ds:297:176:Dialogue Text", "source": "No kidding!", "sourceSha256": "0020e07a62d4c15841bc44ac11259d1a4ea4c008b4bbcc475b6977ad19dc68e7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "17fe2855640fb29dc4c8974da99109f1ac170b72f27cc03ad0ec04d47e3a4a28"}
{"id": "ds:297:177:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Y’know… There is this one girl at the lagoon…", "sourceSha256": "3f58dd08be09f1e7e599913b6e9a0a144a810d110a1c8f53691097bb89a704e8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "94ceac4f7417fdb1a008e902b8bdc6ab2ba50d3e93c2db6f857643fee997311d"}
{"id": "ds:297:178:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Hmm! Y’know after hearing it aloud, it seems so obvious.", "sourceSha256": "14715fd872d49cabb379ba61a4d46a83193ebaad61a44274304eb7ef97f4cf91", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0f4d0a4fc37c9f96bb75f76aa822417f9f165ccf9e1c0dda8bcfc9f9e64aad80"}
{"id": "ds:297:179:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]I could always let her know what I’m looking for, I’m sure she’d understand!", "sourceSha256": "4f0c28f47471bb67bf34fc24951dabeb5f698be58e78c73e5a41cf178cdeff75", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a68948954b04e1201617fb114e30b49e6e95cc2fc658c8d2038167f2de874943"}
{"id": "ds:297:180:Dialogue Text", "source": "Exactly", "sourceSha256": "c4c6442371ea9f711963bc20a3105f442c19cf2b5448026bcbb2cfbe41af1dc9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0692a069c6a865f1a17baca5b2135acef53f88c951d635265db714b7ba475fdc"}
{"id": "ds:297:181:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]But…", "sourceSha256": "0bf29746374bd46d52d41db907d88f8c555e59e738238a9a2450293e613ac78f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ec1af4098f9616188206941774a6cfea41ae057ec788a22f4df3b20c3921a8a3"}
{"id": "ds:297:182:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Part of me thinks I actually WANT to be serious with her…", "sourceSha256": "e225a0af4e6494abd3fc2f8add30ee0abff820e9831ea5486d059a80eaf7ac4f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ca46fdeef4f9c9a862f6efc34a9f7e1adb76347569071bd00936772c807d4bff"}
{"id": "ds:297:183:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oooh… the plot thickens?", "sourceSha256": "54117d7308d51bec682d8f8d012d814f5ef385bd23afba206b5bc366dde548b7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2540ebc9fa022064d74f911c10270f93b95a1fad225a018a4fc55d8fabb9991e"}
{"id": "ds:297:184:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I’m serious Red! This is kinda why I was avoiding it… I don’t wanna mess it up…", "sourceSha256": "bf672fa86aa0ffc73c450809675a90518c16f0b97dc8c96c0b55bfee5471c757", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "385985df7ac8f848a15dad9884f275dacd5a62cdd6eddf5a17b5ee1142cfb3c4"}
{"id": "ds:297:185:Dialogue Text", "source": "Mmm, I think you should talk to her.\nYou wouldn’t want to miss\nthis experience entirely, right?", "sourceSha256": "a584a8e23e228587120207e3828b8480dd654c8cd1d44e5d625152f27c796e46", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9c839b74aa3f68b30c9c72c0b621413bfcdf2f87ff06466df38261e7c7808f5a"}
{"id": "ds:297:186:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oh?", "sourceSha256": "a6a744d6d60ec4004f74bbb5ae879acf86825c65a42e5cd612d795bed85cbe84", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "aaa2460ce3900ad16cb404266640035fbda9bc684731b9c467f4b0581b821d89"}
{"id": "ds:297:187:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Yeah, we’d share passing glances occasionally…", "sourceSha256": "9d2492664ea40a5892da9eb5911f635c2bed71764ff1fe068a638fcf61ff53b2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "488552b95892e9c68bf03a43e5b8ac33138c68a47e680947f7d8ea4895daf023"}
{"id": "ds:297:188:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Some flirty smiles and gestures here ’n there, but the last time I saw her…", "sourceSha256": "2472aa68eafe7faf2f7c39adc082a0aa9514a48f9b88b7d5cf381eb88176145f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "58b045cae01c21f49db5760e8cf408f30b75fdba3a903efef7207f040381cbb6"}
{"id": "ds:297:189:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I dunno…", "sourceSha256": "d57a96f335e232dd7db8d90c3e5e9814266cada6b82b3f56837cdc3c1d2b4638", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "bc7d6ccd093f377866fe29c168e64e910790dfde2587c4017d3ac44fccf95190"}
{"id": "ds:297:190:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I’m usually pretty surface level when fooling with the critters there.", "sourceSha256": "f132c2eb58f26f3ce27017fb36ae32aedaafb2b50d208bf75e1775baea66a525", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "31b0d0e5a3bb9631200f6eca01a935ebf23dc769754439a20f3cd960f2660690"}
{"id": "ds:297:191:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]But there’s something different about her…", "sourceSha256": "59ec7199c8939e1b498f55168758a0785357251d3b8baca388a3d9bcbc3078e7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e2e9c2084218fdb00c5b38a127f15a07e5fb850dbe5d167f8dba8bbf88839d8c"}
{"id": "ds:297:192:Dialogue Text", "source": "What do you mean?", "sourceSha256": "c8ac7dce03b1b9b73d09f9d628650393280722336ab394f0fe830107d597c867", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "138ebfac40392ab922e32422fd378fd97656f6d5de871524b0dbe781213fd19a"}
{"id": "ds:297:193:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Well… Let me summarize the situation…", "sourceSha256": "e7ad79e67d221339ee27bc7dba547443df222910f433c725bbba3d694b39d719", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "886e8294dccd11c71447bf0e02f6a57059ca02391198e6b3841f3393b636fc25"}
{"id": "ds:297:194:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Yeah… That’s true…", "sourceSha256": "c549e43528b827e7862e02387a8625f183440663739faaa6027b139fb5828a5a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "6905086b8a7faf5428eda6b16607fe5adcefd3096b3b6a6fb093b2bf36e5e172"}
{"id": "ds:297:195:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]I think you’re right, Red! I’ll talk to her!", "sourceSha256": "4a934b99b10dfb8229d52de73042d6d49ead2768d2f9dd355e9ac5e6c0ef7a64", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "488de0054f1c1b1afc547266f4fa9aea90d7faefba4f6c5a08cd66a94d9d27f0"}
{"id": "ds:297:196:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Thanks for the encouragement!", "sourceSha256": "72ab906acf81a2d830886c803fd8764cc3e51896f35835688e24a2ab994acbc9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "4c3b71faa615502f12e1ab4a4b94d8a0c94a12a3edd0412a91c44dc2f1e9111e"}
{"id": "ds:297:197:Dialogue Text", "source": "And thank you\nfor the saucy story!", "sourceSha256": "376b0ee9a020ddc2b404d9e8be4c37724b4163bfa857f78be474caa83dc7ba09", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "bd02f5aff8e15d68de0d349da0578099e6f51c7c03e45c4574e97c86ac88680b"}
{"id": "ds:297:198:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]It’s a lil’ spicy though, so be prepared!", "sourceSha256": "9073881a5a9199b737b85fbb489132285ded04a489cc77b7890d841a9744d1b2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "54e884640fbabad6a11ec389710ba58f92daeb491690e681738542607e5c3711"}
{"id": "ds:348:501:Dialogue Text", "source": "Definitely! Hopefully I can\nlast longer next time…", "sourceSha256": "5ef3823367c6419e35707a13b06d8654bbc84241d984481e7042957c2114f7d5", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ee3c26fe817f142bb6b9bb68b55dd50a40a48cd885dadbf8323d9f2020619ff0"}
{"id": "ds:348:503:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Haha, no worries mate! It happens!", "sourceSha256": "391c6602409635999c22b70455407dec865499c43b883b0c1dc2cce219342f67", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "297f7dd08957caf461884498743baeea58959d73fc31c132860b3b04639ab675"}
{"id": "ds:348:504:Dialogue Text", "source": "I think I have a soft spot\nfor you smaller critters…", "sourceSha256": "e38f6b7c718e6c63238008123b550080f3483f7c2da3587f2587b6142b78407c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "97002b5e17b7bfe4ed6db55848f15ab0de57f43457fbf762a78de010e982acb6"}
{"id": "ds:348:506:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]It’s the Magic Mabel Touch! No one can resist it!", "sourceSha256": "a89df4997b0da3347292a6624e7b1bee0aaa8e8fb74b113ddd6a080c33997ac7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ab96920c620e75e776caa60da5c4634f5b16f21517ebb1dd21acdb6ee9f4cadc"}
{"id": "ds:348:508:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]That’s true!", "sourceSha256": "01cfad94949f202134ba8c666008d415cd63dd8687c79418652ca8df1801c54d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "87bdc3869ce62006c5a547f5ac82e536045f983be6b632cb65272eed98e9b839"}
{"id": "ds:432:717:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oh, can I?", "sourceSha256": "863c283ee1cf06cc9f473903452abfc46357d97d2bcb8f00a3668ea27e677a59", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "cf30b96a4c143329b4ce722923ee0f857fd2c97fa9a7ffa8a7a62475875619b8"}
{"id": "ds:432:718:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Of course!", "sourceSha256": "a6fa8a71b3eb5369a98dd97275b29b233ca9dfebe63b4718e607bff4ba40213a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "10d50b3da4ad860543439ad47713c7e2a2713449f01dc5363cab3539ce6036f2"}
{"id": "ds:432:719:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]We just finished up the clothed portion! I’ll show ya them later, some really nice shots!", "sourceSha256": "64a763166a2ca6b474bded273c7df4221d7b0d90783cc65a7ca13341dd94f799", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9a3f06acce6d4dff08b2754d5070ec90947ba876529305244d09cf6d3e1a207f"}
{"id": "ds:432:720:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]But now we’re moving onto the spicy stuff, so I’m grabbing the video camera!", "sourceSha256": "810b82fd0ada4c9de267106bec065952bd57c8a8a2eadfb8708855124620974d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "394689ff7bdc96d854ef1b67242c09329ad530f28727bbe33d987c207b553b27"}
{"id": "ds:432:721:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Do you wanna use the photo camera?", "sourceSha256": "df63c84da0f0f2acc9e661c02fc0adb706c1d4a104a4f3116a0cc6755a028e26", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "212a9ce1d277951d5da7cd1760128de073d1566b4ba202007233d3172ebca625"}
{"id": "ds:432:722:Dialogue Text", "source": "Yeah you bet!", "sourceSha256": "bb9dfd779c6a8ee23ebeffda17d42627c859e6d2d9b1c170afbfa5bdf47afa4e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f22ba9366378ca5db269a974fce6947b7f1ea836af6f4027281cea892b13d580"}
{"id": "ds:432:723:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Great! Grab that camera and come on back!", "sourceSha256": "ef58872600df4f73b8a86df58f7f4b98c3fac217a6678dd8bf58691e9f3757c6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e4808eb017fe74c67b2b46f1a3776a515cd00df8c97d8b882bb12ea43c7bc999"}
{"id": "ds:439:817:Dialogue Text", "source": "*pant pant* Well! *pant pant* How was that?", "sourceSha256": "0dbf8d2e8057ec18b98688ac02c6f44c7bf2c1cce74420c39a2df3ac6488016c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0fa3ba5060b15b0e7efe4a6fa7f4d89ce5ac36be775cea3aa3803aa068b5a110"}
{"id": "ds:439:819:Dialogue Text", "source": "Yeah this is great stuff Melody, you’re really workin’ this camera!", "sourceSha256": "ba57dee2194735b524466d4d1061116e7aeaaf390900e9ffd3d498f1db2c713f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2aafbf6696aa5e299a9e48ad2b6fd883ea425bb1b329e3a7d8eb6ea99f972af6"}
{"id": "ds:439:820:Dialogue Text", "source": "This isn’t your first time, is it?", "sourceSha256": "a8d15a74494ef7cd57390f642c94aa3a893ea17bc91922ffaa8dc83560df05ea", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "28af41e9ba72ce0cc2097f5dcf1dbd4a2ea9f2737fb71e669487daaa6f1e1bf5"}
{"id": "ds:439:837:Dialogue Text", "source": "But do you think I’d have myself on display like this often?", "sourceSha256": "1a4114343451482275d38ffc27d86d5959710d9d9ed0913efb881946342972e7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1ae737131ec8bae0a62955b0553d7360a2e651cdbf6ea5e02bd7f7c631fbedab"}
{"id": "ds:439:839:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oh… erm, I didn’t mean anything by that…", "sourceSha256": "58039eaa9faad604c9e370f413390d96c502d9d4cb4033b99a76c614f65aa582", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d45abf80bf28dd0a0dd36db46f7cce5c8bf9a4d831ebbe6d780aff06c59fe61c"}
{"id": "ds:439:841:Dialogue Text", "source": "Haha, I’m joking. You boys aren’t the first to get a show like this.", "sourceSha256": "ec6b48ccea2e4ac563b8eae76e31d58098df91229aad0309e673eb2139fe5a05", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "fa14577a2fce6254e67bb72c009e5752e9a1f2c7a0546fee1fc1cc32b13aae2c"}
{"id": "ds:439:842:Dialogue Text", "source": "Won’t be the last either…", "sourceSha256": "78dc946ca781ca2df47e612760a248a9b6fae7cdf420c760b0ce2b10b92fd10d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5512d5257139f2f6f333c70a9757b4e15a2c278b5c3aecd19ac02f82b3fc0368"}
{"id": "ds:439:843:Dialogue Text", "source": "Let’s move on, while I’m still worked up…", "sourceSha256": "667b6aafaf8c0aa99bb57cccd69508c8e94028fa2dcaf0792171cdb774773c30", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "4e0e2b73e1ec726f8f98f7afbb3bb535a01e68fdc7d1cda4fb7f3fa4237c1d06"}
{"id": "ds:439:845:Dialogue Text", "source": "Sounds good", "sourceSha256": "5f4ba2659306eb08e7f29992880f33b93bd81dcf227b8769f71d5f15f4916ce8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "491e90977cd197108ef158113c881629c8c45b3c14085de21287c0281658491f"}
{"id": "ds:440:735:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Nice shootin’, Red!", "sourceSha256": "e8f8630afa27fddcf472d6f3e013309bdf0a44daa508dde82f772d31fa645a88", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2089fa0a77b0dc33d23b640f48bcb1f7a7e178ab60486e1bc2fe590e455da8cf"}
{"id": "ds:451:766:Dialogue Text", "source": "She’d go back and forth from lickin’ and fondling with her paws.", "sourceSha256": "7ea857a72c740be2b24aeafdd256edaed1e46d36afb0219aa5d8f648f5f54a60", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d4d7cacd98344d77654b24936a70f4462a86c4823731efcfb8cb4500aa9d1f4d"}
{"id": "ds:451:767:Dialogue Text", "source": "*Fade to 2*", "sourceSha256": "11c5b06f44e38d773e97cf4a3af5d9901944633abbe8d884a1a053ac2f86c815", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "fcb3bcf7bb5452165ea93744ea67a62d9201741126d35d82e4ac2085bfb1662c"}
{"id": "ds:451:768:Dialogue Text", "source": "Then she’d come up and give me a huge wet kiss.", "sourceSha256": "4a4dbd1aa13ff7d34513162d44a89bb3ebb97b4dd1c223148ffea1a6c57aa180", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "542d8e186b6508d6e0f1e6c814b1dd02cdf049620b888fa7c095d65fee75fa85"}
{"id": "ds:451:769:Dialogue Text", "source": "We’d make out a bit, and then I noticed… As things started heating up, she’d slow down…", "sourceSha256": "26c9bef3eadc4635d06f2a0cd7aa0e79e8dcc4f03114d938e47f01da96993282", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "96327738e3b09d56b82c9fd17a236f22a2b7408417fae22bc1275c687bdfa461"}
{"id": "ds:451:770:Dialogue Text", "source": "And she’d go back and forth, getting me reaaaaallly excited, then easing off!", "sourceSha256": "d9e4c0cf56f3333faeda8b61ed13b1853aab576815cdc7048ea49d1e8d5a76ba", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "af690595f72f4a744125d11824f134d09274f100cc054512a7e9455db77fafea"}
{"id": "ds:451:772:Dialogue Text", "source": "But then…", "sourceSha256": "521100aa3d165638e0d87be6fdd13bd2ad49ec815a4651ff93ad8e88cb8d8eb6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b2a686a49fe91eca9a805557f488d06f2dd1c5be65e461e84c98bba6a45b6605"}
{"id": "ds:457:837:Dialogue Text", "source": "Ahhh yeah, that’s the stuff…", "sourceSha256": "c8583023eb31f04b2ce8cc2502ffdf8722cff784bb2aafa4fe00b2069f070d13", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "36705de8b1ad498baadc2f0d7c99a5d98d7039c0f8df34d7ad333a85e814d1da"}
{"id": "ds:457:838:Dialogue Text", "source": "Lap up that pre while you’re at it…", "sourceSha256": "629a3087088f9c270ebd507664f50d2169833719a039bfa4fc7c343a3c08391d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "41cb1ef7c4cfc0304081e1f7f5f750da60dcb813520a34b760711f1871e38366"}
{"id": "ds:457:839:Dialogue Text", "source": "Rascal:", "sourceSha256": "2a278478bc3cae82447f7d01a4f3792f06fd9fa93d38d8c3cf152bcbaa39eacb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e59cc8345f852ebe53cbc07df1b4818b6b335e129eca43865e9138fd564c277b"}
{"id": "ds:457:840:Dialogue Text", "source": "Heh, I feel ya twitching.", "sourceSha256": "669a83464837517bb69b7fc646f09230f1eaf1030ef2caa7c1c825e400cdd63d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "85847f6b71b550998c77901f474e309f7a9652e5d73a6d39c7957e1f519fd578"}
{"id": "ds:457:841:Dialogue Text", "source": "Big ole guy like you sensitive to a lil tongue like mine?", "sourceSha256": "73f0472d59f6dc38e184fe103147ad7c7a9a411d21271a6604174179490c92a2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e46c884b871576f0e0eb18775953dadf4cca78f7c33a7b1b70882bdabb7fb2b2"}
{"id": "ds:457:842:Dialogue Text", "source": "Bear 2:", "sourceSha256": "785a132356c07c545a385e23656fba7805f191ee6050c85950105823e68897ee", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d4c4031f946b6aba6ed7db5fbf680645aa89911a74e97f853cfdc5af34eabd82"}
{"id": "ds:457:844:Dialogue Text", "source": "Rascal:", "sourceSha256": "2a278478bc3cae82447f7d01a4f3792f06fd9fa93d38d8c3cf152bcbaa39eacb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "58d329da5aaf9c576bc3812ef69eaf0f640cb36bc5dc8cf7eaf7541021d3b88e"}
{"id": "ds:457:846:Dialogue Text", "source": "Bear 2:", "sourceSha256": "785a132356c07c545a385e23656fba7805f191ee6050c85950105823e68897ee", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2de141f2ff1ce61f2adafa5de53a89bcbd1af6dffb64c92929e67ec9b0b14809"}
{"id": "ds:457:847:Dialogue Text", "source": "Alright, I’m about to lose it.", "sourceSha256": "7cfb3bca2aedb65628b2789c197491de0d408cf59c08c3d72facab802122f1d2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "6cdcd2ec21ee4587a5bcd6378a23edd59760f924c5e44e73b7a862009a398c39"}
{"id": "ds:457:848:Dialogue Text", "source": "Think you can wrap your mouth around me?", "sourceSha256": "2e7a69d25df76328b770ff35911d20c2b117d1ba3a63714d065ac4cdc0387a04", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ef9d43c9ae97d59db009764fc047b63e1cedad887884485a36870a6b7d635368"}
{"id": "ds:457:849:Dialogue Text", "source": "Rascal:", "sourceSha256": "2a278478bc3cae82447f7d01a4f3792f06fd9fa93d38d8c3cf152bcbaa39eacb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "448a1e1583274650940463ed598a369426a40b2a8229214515e3f65926998e04"}
{"id": "ds:457:850:Dialogue Text", "source": "You bet!", "sourceSha256": "97a64874c35f0e4fe51fe1c9ebb2125b566250ec0e9e3d026f5db3a79923a418", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b276475ce0958c658360a7d376f6f716bbf6748aabedf35c8333468f04869431"}
{"id": "ds:463:752:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]What’s up Red?", "sourceSha256": "213950454ba9fbab49aadac94a23b8370fc2817bd509ca1ff1a69b4681c35322", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d2e271183121602d2bf024157722e22f3842bb2e8809623c9c86594c9db03d57"}
{"id": "ds:463:753:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Ya bored? Need a job?", "sourceSha256": "110bea89e42ff132fd4ec2bffe0f3f2233812d0b0265f897d12f89f6043e36d6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "de981077d09ad33fb29639afb544c689b97f7c3baa7cf8a734d85d271bf986ff"}
{"id": "ds:463:754:Dialogue Text", "source": "No, I’m ok!", "sourceSha256": "5bfe897844e8441f89aa0b338d553ef24c2f932cf54df87fd9de5d278c4be40c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "742bc4f319da3162fd68482887d982e23e91f1585e8234522e583b2c315759f1"}
{"id": "ds:463:755:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]<size=18>Aight then SCRAM!</size>", "sourceSha256": "d9d3a64371ff3bd621c9abb47e33c4c747cc780a90983729f292619ed8800e05", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ca966ebb373c01bcfd883f09afec005d448767bb768221f2cce62299335a0ea2"}
{"id": "ds:463:756:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Just messin’, you’re welcome here any time.", "sourceSha256": "a8098e2c132f0c3181d37e51b02f293786d388ecaebc3a70ecca35e21c70809e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "63fb79904559cdd61dcf36877ce70d0eeadc5e29e5189c8803be5a3df91440e3"}
{"id": "ds:463:757:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Hey Red, you’re not pulling some elaborate prank on us with all the shenanigans going on, right?", "sourceSha256": "955ca2aa295beb8c074af01c4a1b94045eeffbdaead4623d8f2dae160b7d3a49", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "74e675ef70e3ca9ca6c6fe150f6c86f6416015cd1fb36c0029a4249532a8e488"}
{"id": "ds:463:758:Dialogue Text", "source": "It is known that Red Pandas\ncan control the weather!", "sourceSha256": "fb508c070f64c7a5d42eb784731878e93836764ceac5702d95888075c6d53ff4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "adfd0662f1df4d76388f4cf5c17c5d2b018e4d41287bda4d4707959abca6d4e6"}
{"id": "ds:463:759:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]I knew it!", "sourceSha256": "f5afd4d32fcd34c3254415fbc6fc9330f0f3d3b0b1fbba0faee1c1dc7849b49d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "55d5a25a2e85d70084453acb280cf5bec005c3969cd61b3322c8e3edebd80196"}
{"id": "ds:954:866:Dialogue Text", "source": "This was the first time we’d been alone.", "sourceSha256": "5086d9e16a4928d40d2a45ec6e2c1ef1f6e554d31cf13c13db4542b381fc7838", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7ff69b2ce62707733e0e5be4f3337674a2b6ba81272f014aa46ac5efcc0d3c9e"}
{"id": "ds:954:867:Dialogue Text", "source": "I knew he was up to something, but I wasn’t too familiar with his language of flirting or anything.", "sourceSha256": "acb104c673be9eb105aaa17d55e89737959e4958b8467dd39252d15929c15dbf", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e45d9cb5efd222cf3389046b1bb3116db42c72f34076772fdc7c0385c0e16ce5"}
{"id": "ds:954:868:Dialogue Text", "source": "But, I’m no stranger to curious critters, so I let him do his thing.", "sourceSha256": "b0666095ab188c47fd619ddb8da1214551392a37eaebbe8be4a5b7772b36684b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1236e7eb91441c060e4ef95c99b5dc808444858934bceafee39f3bc45769ba2a"}
{"id": "ds:954:869:Dialogue Text", "source": "He started climbing around and sizing up my assets.", "sourceSha256": "cee2d777406f18a18a2fb2aeb1a23d7d3cc4cc337d44befe3ff69aa83583dda6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "11479a015937d5db500fa6d22c1420f09714e783eccb037bbfddaa883df6e5ed"}
{"id": "ds:954:870:Dialogue Text", "source": "It kinda felt like a doctor exam! Regardless, the attention was exciting to me…", "sourceSha256": "1b67cdd2200b9cfe3b5849be0c1a554235d2b2ebaef4d96f4940af3b32cf040e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/th/repair-01/complete-delta-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ffe1643a13ab4c824b80efd22f3e8e7a9d17b4a7c31689ec31c5847b18016e31"}
